%% RAG grounded answer with layered abstention (pipeline.py answer())
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Workbench screen<br/>(P&ID tag, Investigation, Upload & Ask)
  participant BR as hyperion-bridge<br/>POST /hyperion/mrpl/evidence/answer
  participant SV as RAG service<br/>POST /v1/answer
  participant RT as retrieve()<br/>BM25 + dense, RRF k=60, rerank top 30
  participant LLM as gpt-oss<br/>(temperature 0, JSON reply)
  participant CV as build_citations()<br/>locate() quote on page

  UI->>BR: {question, documentIds?}
  BR->>SV: question, documentIds, limit
  SV->>RT: query (mode hybrid_rerank when dense + rerank load)
  RT-->>SV: top-k hits
  alt no hits
    SV-->>BR: abstain, reason no_evidence
  else gate set and top rerank score below gate
    Note over SV: gate is a parameter of answer(). rag.py query passes it.<br/>The HTTP service calls answer() without a gate.
    SV-->>BR: abstain, reason retrieval_gate#lt;x#gt;
  else evidence found
    SV->>SV: expand_neighbors (same-doc chunks, max 8 blocks)
    SV->>LLM: system prompt + evidence blocks E1..En
    LLM-->>SV: {answer, abstain, citations[block, quote]}
    alt model abstains or replies NOT_IN_EVIDENCE
      SV-->>BR: abstain, reason model
    else answer with quotes
      SV->>CV: each quote vs its cited block
      CV-->>SV: doc_id, page, char span, quote_verified
      alt no quote verifies
        SV-->>BR: abstain, reason no_verified_citation (answer withheld)
      else at least one verified quote
        SV-->>BR: answer + citations + footnotes
      end
    end
  end
  BR-->>UI: MrplEvidenceAnswerResponse {abstain, abstainReason, citations[n, documentId, page, quote, verified]}
  Note over UI: abstain: describeAbstain(code, subject)<br/>else: answer + numbered citations
